---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-about.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Still Green"
	description="Still Green covers green energy, eco-friendly products, and sustainable living — made simple."
	pubDate={new Date('April 24 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Still Green is a weekly resource for anyone who wants to live more
		sustainably without spending hours researching. We cover solar power,
		home energy tools, and eco-friendly products that actually work.
	</p>
	<p>
		Every post gives you a straightforward breakdown — what the product or
		technology does, who it's for, and whether it's worth the investment.
	</p>
	<p>
		No greenwashing. No vague advice. Just clear, practical information to
		help you make better choices.
	</p>
	<h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you purchase through them,
		we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This helps us keep the
		content free. We only recommend products we genuinely believe are worth using.
	</p>
</Layout>